Difference Between Use Case Diagram and Activity Diagram
Use Case Diagram	Activity Diagram
Shows system functionality	Shows workflow/process
Focuses on user interaction	Focuses on activity flow
Static view	Dynamic view
Uses actors and use cases	Uses actions and control flow
Steps to Draw Activity Diagram
Identify process
Determine activities
Define decision points
Connect activities with arrows
Add start and end nodes
Add fork/join if parallel tasks exist
